uired</p></td><td><p class="s3">DSGL</p></td></tr><tr><td/>&nbsp;</td><td><p class="s3">DFAT</p></td><td><p class="s3">Items to countries subject to UN sanctions.*</p></td><td><p class="s3">PE Regs;regulations made under the UN Charter**</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="3"><p class="s2">FIREARMS, NON-MILITARY</p></td><td/>&nbsp;</td><td/>&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td rowspan="2"><p class="s4"></p></td><td rowspan="2"><p class="s3">Including commercial &amp; sporting firearms</p></td><td><p class="s3">Defence</p></td><td><p class="s3">If under 5 weapons in passenger baggage, an RGP is issued by Customs, otherwise a Defence DED permit is required</p></td><td><p class="s3">DSGL</p></td></tr><tr><td><p class="s3">DFAT</p></td><td><p class="s3">Items to countries subject to UN sanctions.*</p></td><td><p class="s3">PE Regs;regulations made under the UN Charter**</p></td></tr><tr><td rowspan="2"><p class="s4"></p></td><td rowspan="2"><p class="s3">Parts, components &amp; accessories designed or adapted for use</p></td><td><p class="s3">Defence</p></td><td><p class="s3">If not accompanying firearms on an RGP, a Defence DED permit is required</p></td><td><p class="s3">DSGL</p></td></tr><tr><td><p class="s3">DFAT</p></td><td><p class="s3">Items to countries subject to UN sanctions.*</p></td><td><p class="s3">PE Regs;regulations made under the UN Charter**</p></td></tr></table><p><br/></p><table cellspacing="0"><tr><td colspan="8"><p class="s2">FISH AND SEAFOOD <span class="s3">(aquatic vertebrates and aquatic invertebrates, amphibians including crustacea, aquatic reptiles, finfish, shell fish,fish products &amp; all forms of marine life)</span></p></td><td/>&nbsp;</td><td/>&nbsp;</td><td/>&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td><p class="s4"></p></td><td colspan="7"><p class="s3">Dried</p></td><td><p class="s3">DAFF</p></td><td colspan="2"><p class="s3">AQIS Fish permit required for exports over 2kg (dried abalone requires a permit)</p></td></tr><tr><td/>&nbsp;</td><td/>&nbsp;</td><td/>&nbsp;</td>