f practice</p></td><td rowspan="2"><p class="s3">DAFF</p></td><td colspan="2"><p class="s3">Permit from DAFF required for exports over 2T</p></td></tr><tr><td/>&nbsp;</td><td/>&nbsp;</td><td/>&nbsp;</td><td/>&nbsp;</td><td/>&nbsp;</td><td/>&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td><p class="s4"></p></td><td colspan="5"><p class="s3">Other unprocessed wood (including logs &amp; sawn logs, excluding woodchips)</p></td><td/>&nbsp;</td><td/>&nbsp;</td><td/>&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td/>&nbsp;</td><td/>&nbsp;</td><td><p class="s6">o</p></td><td colspan="3"><p class="s3">From a State with an approved forestry code of practice</p></td><td><p class="s3">DAFF</p></td><td colspan="2"><p class="s3">State forestry controls may apply</p></td></tr><tr><td/>&nbsp;</td><td/>&nbsp;</td><td><p class="s6">o</p></td><td colspan="3"><p class="s3">From a State without an approved forestry code of practice</p></td><td><p class="s3">DAFF</p></td><td colspan="2"><p class="s3">Permit from DAFF required for exports over 2T</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="6"><p class="s2">X-RAY EQUIPMENT</p></td><td/>&nbsp;</td><td/>&nbsp;</td><td/>&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td><p class="s4"></p></td><td colspan="5"><p class="s3">For other than medical use</p></td><td><p class="s3">Defence</p></td><td><p class="s3">Defence permit required</p></td><td><p class="s3">DSGL</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="6"/>&nbsp;</td><td><p class="s3">DAFT</p></td><td><p class="s3">Items to the DPRK subject to UN sanctions (Luxury Goods List)</p></td><td><p class="s5">Charter of the United Nations (Sanctions- Democratic People&#39;s Republic of Korea) Regulations 2006</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="6"><p class="s2">YACHTS</p><p class="s3">(see VESSELS)</p></td><td/>&nbsp;</td><td/>&nbsp;</td><td/>&nbsp;</td></tr></table><p><br/></p><table cellspacing="0"><tr><td/>&nbsp;</td><td/>&nbsp;</td><td/>&nbsp;</td><td/>&nbsp;</td><td/>&nbsp;</td><td/>&nbsp;</td><td/>&nbsp;</td><td/>&nbsp;</td><td/>&nbsp;</td><td/>&nbsp;</td><td/>&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td colspan="11"><p 